  "P39": "Complete exact commit footprint: 13 paths = 6 mechanism rows, 5 source/test/documentation companion rows, plus 2 required LEASES/index metadata paths. Required metadata is outside mechanism count; every actual commit path is enumerated.",
  "P40": "SAME/deeper read-only presence/admission class. R1 exposed Path.exists collapsing dangling links and status failures into absence. R2 widens one generic classifier across both selected blob and manifest paths and all components; R3 adds a real pending-transaction behavioral witness for both writer and read-only public APIs. No separate symlink/error ladder or new semantic class.",
  "property": "For the exact selected CAS manifest view, read-only has/read returns false only for a genuinely absent selected view. A dangling link, non-regular path component, incomplete present blob/manifest pair, unreadable member, or pending publication transaction must refuse with the typed error and leave the CAS tree unchanged. R2 applies a generic component-wise classifier across blob and selected-manifest paths; R3 behaviorally exercises all public read methods on both writer and read-only reader after the normal writer persists a pending intent.",
